<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέπ-ασμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a covering</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ς. ὑποπετάσματα μὲν ἄλλα,
					περικαλύμματα δὲ ἕτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					279d
				</span></i>
			; of a cap or shoe, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				942d
			</span></i>; of clothing generally, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1336a17
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυχες ς. τῶν ἀκρωτηρίων εἰσίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					687b24
				</span></i>
			; <i>covering membrane</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				780b28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φύλλον περικαρπίου
			ς</span>., in plants, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>de An.</u>
				412b2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία ς. ἐκ πλίνθων καὶ λίθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1043a32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
